  "prefLabel": "Jus 413.01 Time and Scope of Investigations",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 413.01 Time and Scope of Investigations. In accordance with RSA 7:24, the director shall conduct such investigations as the director deems necessary to fulfill the director’s responsibilities in connection with the supervision, administration, and enforcement of charitable trusts, charitable solicitations, and charitable sales promotions.\n\nSource. #13455, eff 10-7-22; ss by #14162, eff 12-27-24",
